name, networkLoadBalancerId
Lookup filters: name
Lookup matching: exact name match within
the resource scope; duplicate matches
fail
end note
opt force-new or conflicting drift is detected
ServiceManager --> BaseReconciler: reject before OCI mutation
end
opt supported mutable drift is detected
ServiceManager -> OCI: Apply UpdateListener only for\nmutable fields\ndefaultBackendSetName, ipVersion,\nisPpv2Enabled, l3IpIdleTimeout (+4\nmore)
loop update pending ACCEPTED,\nIN_PROGRESS, CANCELING
ServiceManager -> OCI: GetListener
end
end
ServiceManager -> OCI: run helper hooks\ncreate=tfresource.CreateResource;\nupdate=tfresource.UpdateResource;\ndelete=tfresource.DeleteResource
ServiceManager -> OCI: apply follow-up strategy\ncreate=workrequest;\nupdate=workrequest;\ndelete=confirm-delete
end
ServiceManager --> BaseReconciler: status=required,\nfinalizer=retain-until-confirmed-delete
end
BaseReconciler --> Controller: requeue on provisioning, updating,\nterminating
